| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| `U_batt`         | Battery voltage                         | V  |   14.0 |
| `t_pulse`         | Activation pulse width                         | s  |   3e-3 |
| `t_start`         | Start of the activation pulse                         | s  |   0.5e-3 |
| `dp_rail`         | Rail pressure above the manifold, 3 bar (Bosch EV14 rating)                         | Pa  |   3e5 |
| `R_on`         | Driver on-resistance (assumed)                         | Ω  |   0.1 |
| `t_switch`         | Driver switching time constant (assumed)                         | s  |   1e-6 |
